WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:05.040
SCP-343 God Vs SCP-049 The Plague Doctor.&nbsp;

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:08.720
How would a battle between this pair&nbsp;
of legendary anomalies play out?

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:14.160
343 and 049 are both entities capable of&nbsp;
reason and logic. Would there even be a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:18.320
true “fight to the death'' battle between the&nbsp;
two? Perhaps, instead of fighting, they would&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:23.840
engage in a spirited debate on the nature of&nbsp;
science, health, and of course, The Pestilence.

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:28.080
Through collaboration, perhaps we can&nbsp;
even discover the true nature of this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:34.160
elusive Pestilence, and finally&nbsp;
bring SCP-049 some much-needed peace.

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:38.160
Hey, if anyone could manage it,&nbsp;
we’d say God is a strong contender.

